    "conditions": "Development bundler configuration with release native artifacts. Optimizations, incremental, Rspack caches, loader cache and Babel disk/config caches disabled. Every large JS module runs parallel Babel parse/print and imports one CSS Module, processed by builtin CSS (css/module), without css-loader or CSS extract plugin. Identical explicit worker counts.",
